- * tracking descriptor - cannot be used. We instead submit the raw 802.11
- * frame straight to the WMI mgmt-TX command on the monitor vdev, using a
- * private desc_id range ABOVE MGMT_DESC_POOL_MAX (64). The stock completion
- * handler (tgt_mgmt_txrx_tx_completion_handler) cleanly rejects desc_ids in
- * that range, so it never touches our nbuf - we own the unmap/free in
- * wma_inject_handle_completion(), intercepted from wma_mgmt_tx_completion_handler().
